      <div type="clause" n="11[b]">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ger">Ger</ref> 11[b]</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Orceard ræran . 7 mænige inweorc wyrcean. ðerhsan . wudu cleofan . hryðeran styllan. swyn stygian .</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">To tend the orchard and to undertake many indoor duties, threshing, to cleave wood, put cattle in stalls, slaughter pigs.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[11[b]] orceard ræran 7 mænige inweorc wyrcean, ðerhsan, wudu cleofan, hryðeran styllan, swyn stigian,</ab>
